OL,3,GNEWSAHomes will destroy rural setting,
OL,4,Asays museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FBosses at a museum in Worcestershire
OL,7,Fhave hit out at proposals for 293 homes
OL,8,Fnext to their site, saying it would
OL,9,F"destroy" the area's rural setting.
OL,11,FDevelopers want to build an estate on
OL,12,FBuntsford Hill, agricultural land next
OL,13,Fto Avoncroft Museum in Bromsgrove.
OL,15,FZoe Willems, from the museum, said:
OL,16,F"It's absolutely devastating - it will
OL,17,Freally impact on the setting, as well
OL,18,Fas our museum as a whole."
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
